        <h3>
          <a href="/projects/wood-chip-monitor">
            Wood-Chip Monitor: An Edge-AI System for Real-Time Wood-Chip
            Quality Evaluation
          </a>
        </h3>

        <p class="research-entry-authors">
          <strong>Amirhossein Eskorouchi</strong>, Dongmin Ethan Kang, and
